{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed registry of company job boards, as (provider, token) pairs.",
    "",
    "A token is the company's slug on its ATS — the part of its careers URL",
    "that identifies it, e.g. boards.greenhouse.io/TOKEN. These were compiled",
    "from public careers pages and companies move between platforms, so treat",
    "this as a starting point rather than a source of truth: run",
    "`python verify_boards.py` to check every one against the live API and",
    "deactivate the ones that have moved. The app also retires a board on its",
    "own after several consecutive permanent failures.",
    "",
    "Add your own with the 'Add company' box in the Job Hunt tab — paste any",
    "careers URL and the provider and token are worked out from it."
